  "2026-06-03T23:33:28.798Z",codex,"Implemented: (1) httpsPut helper + --update-existing wired into export --push (PUTs provenance items, strips immutable project field; default still skips for back-compat). (2) formatImportProgress + onProgress streaming Fetched N/total to stderr in runImport and jira-sync. (3) countIssueExtras + SEARCH_FIELDS now requests attachment,comment; importer logs a stderr note when present. 46 unit tests pass (3 new). Functional dry-run confirmed 2 CREATE + 2 UPDATE PUT for PROJ-100/PROJ-205, SKIP without flag. No secrets leaked."
