body: "Wire the existing PUT helper into export --push behind a new opt-in --update-existing flag: provenance-matched items are PUT to /rest/api/3/issue/<KEY> (project field stripped) instead of being skipped. Add per-page 'Fetched N/total...' import progress to STDERR. Add a STDERR transparency note when fetched issues carry attachments/comments that are not imported. All additive, offline-testable via --dry-run."
